    :return-type "void",
    :params "mino_state *S",
    :signature "void mino_quiesce_threads(mino_state *S);",
    :doc
    "Wait for all in-flight host threads to finish. Intended to be called\nby the embedder before `mino_state_free`; calling it from a worker\nthread that this state spawned is undefined behaviour. Safe to call\nwhen no threads are in flight (returns immediately)."}
